claude: true
prompt: >
  Drain the Net-Async-Hetzner karr board. Pick the next actionable ticket, delegate
  behavior-relevant work to the net-async-hetzner-worker (tests to
  net-async-hetzner-test-writer, pre-release audit to net-async-hetzner-release-checker),
  verify with `prove -lr -I../p5-www-hetzner/lib t/`, then hand the ticket to review.
  Never run `dzil release` or push without explicit instruction; this dist releases
  together with WWW::Hetzner. Stop when nothing actionable remains.
